      "why": "Not a plugin. It is the caller side of the platform-registrar channel: the account only runs registerPlatformAccount, registerStablePlatformAccount and applyPlatformAccountOwnerRotation when the caller is the registrar it recorded, so measuring that channel means deploying the registrar service itself. The scenario points the service's authorizedCore back at the account and drives it as its own admin, and pinning its bytes is what makes the scenario's claim about who called the account a claim about an artifact."
